  "method": "Per-cell ordinary least-squares linear trend fitted to March observations from 1996\u20132024, extrapolated and clipped to 0\u2013100%. Display outlines use a 15% concentration threshold. A trend extrapolation, not a climate-model forecast; no calibrated probability or confidence interval.",
